@startuml activity-view-products
' View & search products: the Catalog use cases View product list,
' Search products («extend») and View product details.

title View & search products

|Guest|
|Coffee Shop System|

|Guest|
start
:1 · Open the Roasts page;
repeat
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Show the product list;
  |Guest|
  if (What next?) then ([open a product])
    break
  else ([search, filter, sort or page])
    :2 · Search, filter, sort or change page;
  endif
repeat while (back to the list)
|Guest|
:3 · Open Product detail;
|Coffee Shop System|
:Load the product\n(variants, images, stock);
if (Found and on sale?) then ([yes])
  :Show the product details;
else ([no])
  :Show "Product not found";
endif
stop

@enduml
